        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">hibridni razsmernik; 4 MPPT, nizov na MPPT [1, 1, 1, 1], U_dc max 600 V, MPPT [50, 550] V, I max [16, 16, 16, 16] A; baterija [300, 600] V; komunikacija: RS485-1 (EMS / števec / TČ, COM 15-16), RS485-2 (Sigen Sensor SP-DH / SP-CT120-DH, COM 13-14), 2x RJ45 Fast Ethernet (RJ45 1 / RJ45 2), WLAN 2,4 GHz (ANT), 4G Sigen CommMod, 5x DI (DI1-DI4 DRM/RCR, DI5 hitri izklop/NS/EPO), 2x DO suhi kontakt (rezervirano, 12 V / 1 A)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Datasheet - SigenStor EC (Sigen Energy Controller 3.0-12.0 SP / 5.0-30.0 TP), Sigenergy str. 1 (SP), 2 (TP); SigenStor Home Installation Guide - Single-phase (8.0-12.0) A1, v10 (2026-08-17); iz ZIP SigenStor Home Installer Manual - Single-phase System (8.0-12.0) A1_EN.zip str. 3 (AC stikalo), 5 (Port Descriptions), 7 (kabli), 28 (COM 16-pin), 35 (PV nizi); Datasheet - SigenStor BAT 6.0/10.0, Sigenergy (tip baterije LiFePO4) str. 2; teh_iz_ponudb (Generator ponudb SOLION) - obstoječi tehnični zapis s preseki kablov in AC stikali str. polje teh_iz_ponudb pri artiklu</elementInformation>
